    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d888">

                <pb facs="0732" n="656" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg656"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7209</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Collector Cobb to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-14T11:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 14, 1916, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My January 13, 11 a.m. Train bringing employees American Smelting and Refining
                    Company and others from Chihuahua left there this morning 8.30 and should reach
                    El Paso about dark.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
